From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: v0lumehi <aljic.zijad@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 21:21:31 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Launcher: Touch controls size and Left stick rows for a
 game's own iOS app

The shell's settings choose the size of the on-screen controls (DM_TOUCH_SIZE) and where the left stick sits
(DM_TOUCH_STICK), and the engine reads both. A game's own app, shown with launcher.json, had only Touch
feedback, so a standalone IPA had no way to make its touch controls larger or move the stick. Two Controls
rows, platform:ios, with the shell's values and defaults (medium, corner). The arrangement of single controls
(DM_TOUCH_LAYOUT) stays in the shell, and the controller layout stays in the in-game menu. docs/settings.md
describes the rows. Apply after engine-544.diff (they touch the same lines of settings.tsv and settings.md).

Tests: test_launcher_settings.py (the rows, their options and defaults, none on a Mac, the iPhone-only set).

Upstream-Status: pending [seedds/nxnative#TBD, becomes forwarded when the PR is open]
Reason: A standalone game app offers the same touch-control size and left stick choices as the shared shell
Issue: LNPANDY/NX2Apple#991
---
 dm/games/settings.tsv                    | 2 ++
 dm/tools/tests/test_launcher_settings.py | 9 ++++++++-
 docs/settings.md                         | 8 +++++++-
 3 files changed, 17 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/dm/games/settings.tsv b/dm/games/settings.tsv
index 141b0d86..89c69f17 100644
--- a/dm/games/settings.tsv
+++ b/dm/games/settings.tsv
@@ -26,6 +26,8 @@ DM_FULLSCREEN	choice	0=Window,1=Fullscreen	0	platform:mac	Game	Display mode		lev
 DM_PICTURE_FIT	choice	fit=Fit,fill=Fill	fit	platform:ios	Game	Picture	Fill crops the game's 16:9 picture to cover the screen. Health bars, subtitles or maps near the edges can be cut off. A full-screen picture without cropping needs a patch for each game.
 DM_SHOW_FPS	toggle	-	build:DM_SHOW_FPS	platform:ios	Game	Frame-rate counter
 DM_TOUCH_HAPTICS	toggle	-	1	platform:ios	Controls	Touch feedback
+DM_TOUCH_SIZE	choice	small=Small,medium=Medium,large=Large	medium	platform:ios	Controls	Size	The size of the on-screen controls. Controls move toward medium when a size does not fit the screen.
+DM_TOUCH_STICK	choice	corner=Corner,higher=Higher,inward=Inward	corner	platform:ios	Controls	Left stick	Where the left stick of the on-screen controls sits.
 DM_RUMBLE	toggle	-	1	always	Controls	Game rumble		level=basic
 DM_RUMBLE_GAIN	range	0:3:0.1	1.0	always	Controls	Rumble strength		needs=DM_RUMBLE=1
 DM_RUMBLE_MIN	range	0:0.9:0.05	0	always	Controls	Rumble cutoff
diff --git a/dm/tools/tests/test_launcher_settings.py b/dm/tools/tests/test_launcher_settings.py
